on their lovely deck for a perfect afternoon."},{"business_id":"6F8BtCbhjXjvXTcdDQ968Q","review_id":"pMyK1et29DuyWpnsKR-rbA","date":"2012-08-28T14:52:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8876593112945557,"text_excerpt":"Lunches coffee pastry & its in the library? Yes, please. I stopped in for a quick water and some yummy banana bread on my way to sit at a car repair place. But I'll definitely be back. The sandwich menu looked tasty. And the seating while not plentiful was well appointed. I also like that it is separate from the library (no drinks around the books!)"},{"business_id":"6F8BtCbhjXjvXTcdDQ968Q","review_id":"zPaEn7CsRktcehpnE662bQ","date":"2012-12-16T20:44:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8688511848449707,"text_excerpt":"Cool little place and nice coffee. They had good music playing and being adjacent to a library is also nice. Prices are great."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
